The '''Twi'lek healing baths''' were baths associated with members of the [[Twi'lek]] [[species]] that customers visited for healing and relaxation. When [[Greef Karga]] urged the [[Mandalorian]] [[bounty hunter]] [[Din Djarin]] to take some time off and relax<ref name="Chapter 3" /> in [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|3|mention of the [[Twi'lek]] healing baths}}</ref> he suggested they visit the Twi'lek healing baths.<ref name="Chapter 3" />

==Behind the scenes==
The healing baths were mentioned in "[[Chapter 3: The Sin]]," the third episode of the [[The Mandalorian Season One|first season]] of [[Jon Favreau]]'s ''[[Star Wars: The Mandalorian]]''. The episode was written by Favreau and aired on [[Disney+]]<ref name="Chapter 3" /> on [[November 22]], [[2019]].<ref name="DTCI">{{WebCite|url=https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/documents/the_mandalorian_project_one-sheet_10_ec1e005f.pdf|text=The Mandalorian Media Kit|date=2019-09-24|format=[[Wikipedia:PDF|PDF]]|work=[[Wikipedia:Walt Disney Direct-to-Consumer & International|Walt Disney Direct-to-Consumer & International]]|pages=[https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/documents/the_mandalorian_project_one-sheet_10_ec1e005f.pdf#page=1 p. 1]|archivedate=20210623202717}}</ref>

